4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vwD8WNvDkTQQ7kNvwEQ4eMO&_nc_oc=AdqNCbSRkpcvR1Ek1B-K-IVWcfbFhNf6ic7aOShKwmK_v-xG8bOrKVwHvUvJyMmsvGY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOevDnZ_Tk1-kZ4HQbPZUGfW4kazmVUM9R5B3655s9PGw&oe=6AC52A14"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8sj4GR8XtGoQ7kNvwGfAmUH&_nc_oc=AdphpNnl6pMffYn0QygiaOCYWYKSq2Lu3sdqourAxsTWJY2D4Z3zf8TdFjBS-dWO5-8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNsFw_A8iImGo9S98iPKVS51K-JpgiH_VWGsj2w_SNMpg&oe=6AC4F6B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6xG2sR6xScUQ7kNvwFT7N5e&_nc_oc=Ado1uTy_M7VZj4XIET6rXc7i_GfccYKhCNyR5JFYRsjE5rAGLRkJQ09nCFga9A3TFz8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOgqIvElaB9cCdv6dKDnlj_b6js-4bSmH4D9AlyZ2l9Gw&oe=6AC50455"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p